{"status":"success","message":null,"data":{"responsibilities":null,"overview":null,"locations":"Bangalore","processCompleted":false,"deleted":false,"mailPublished":true,"newCompany":false,"dream":false,"notificationMuted":true,"applied":false,"studentOopsOrFrozen":false,"modifyAllowed":false,"withdrawAllowed":false,"withdrawalDeadlineSameAsApplicationDeadline":false,"displayNameSameAsCompanyName":true,"includedInApplicationMatrix":false,"application_detail_id":6063,"application_id":1225,"application_status_id":3,"placement_process_id":44,"batch_group_id":0,"batch_group_ids":"[59, 60]","dayslot_id":0,"cluster_id":0,"cluster_sequence_number":0,"job_function_id":0,"uuid":"a2e7e04d-12ed-41f1-aeb5-8457325c3867","sector_id":29,"company_id":1714,"max_roles_to_be_applied":0,"company_name":"Nablon AI Private Limited","job_title":"Trainee Engineer - Artificial Intelligence ","sector_label":"Consulting Services","other_sector":"","max_roles":0,"job_summary":"","job_function":"","job_description":"","process_name":"FT 2025-26","batch_group_label":"","skills":"Data science , Artificial Intelligence, Python ","website_url":"https://nablon.ai","eligibility_information":"7 CGPA and above","job_package":"","min_work_experience":0,"max_work_experience":0,"is_dream":false,"date_of_visit":null,"publish_time":1775710065000,"withdrawl_deadline":1775809855000,"application_deadline":1775809855000,"application_start_time":1775710250000,"additional_information":"<b><u>About Nablon :&#160;</u></b><div>Nablon is a category-defining agentic AI outcomes startup that combines MBB-grade strategy, engineering precision, and frontier AI to deliver measurable transformation for Fortune 500 clients. We don&#8217;t sell decks &#8212; we deploy real systems that make enterprises faster, smarter, and autonomous.&#160;</div><div>&#160;</div><div>We&#8217;re building the world&#8217;s first Agentic AI Operating Platform where data pipelines, decision systems, and intelligent agents come together to eliminate enterprise bottlenecks. Our investors include tier-1 AI VCs who have backed Postman, H2O.ai, Apollo.io, Hasura, and Zepto.&#160;</div><div>&#160;</div><div><b><u>You will build&#160;</u></b></div><div><br></div><div>Production-ready AI agents and enterprise AI infrastructure, starting with high-impact PoCs that are systematically converted into scalable products. We partner with large enterprises to turn their businesses into AI-first organizations, delivering measurable results through intelligent automation and decision systems.</div><div>Alongside client engagements, we are developing a core AI platform that serves as the backbone for all our AI initiatives &#8212; enabling reusable components, governance, security, and rapid enterprise-scale deployment.</div><div>Our founders, Dr. Ravindra Patil and Sagar Balan, bring years of deep experience in enterprise AI and are widely recognized for their significant contributions to advancing AI adoption in large organizations.</div><div>The role offers end-to-end ownership &#8212; from data ingestion to AI-driven outcomes &#8212; leveraging frameworks like LangChain, deploying on Microsoft Azure, and collaborating with strategic partners such as OpenAI, NVIDIA, and Anthropic to deliver enterprise-grade AI systems at scale.</div>","additional_details":"<div><u><b>Who can apply ?</b></u></div>The filter is for atleast 8 CGPA and above across 10th /12th/ Bachelors&#8217; / Masters&#160;<div><br></div><div><u><b>Interview process :&#160;</b></u></div><div><br></div><div><b>Round 1: </b>Online proctored assignment &gt; Duration - 30-60 mins ( MCQs)</div><div><b>Round 2: </b> Technical Interview &gt; Duration - 1 hour video call along with live coding on GitHub&#160;</div><div><b>Round 3: </b>Technical &amp; Culture Fit &gt; with our CTO - 30 mins&#160;</div><div><b>HR Call </b>: Culture fit &amp; offer discussion</div><div><br></div><div>This is a program that starts with 3 months internship and based on your performance will be converted to the full-time role.&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Here's what you should know about our Internship program , we like to keep it simple : &#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Stipend: INR 20K per month ( this is the industry benchmark for early-stage startups)</div><div>Tenure : 3 months ( 12 weeks at least) and then extend it as a Trainee as a Full-time-Employee . On conversion as an FTE , competitive compensation packages.&#160;</div><div>Performance Assessment : 3 Simple Criteria</div><div>Technical Skills &amp; growth</div><div>Communication</div><div><span>Collaboration</span><br></div>","is_notification_muted":true,"is_withdrawal_same_as_application_deadline":false,"is_new_company":false,"is_display_name_same_as_company_name":true,"is_included_in_application_matrix":false,"display_name":"Nablon AI Private Limited","is_published":true,"is_deleted":false,"is_process_completed":false,"created_by":10870,"created_by_name":"Sneha Vangada","updated_by":10659,"created_at":1775657009000,"updated_at":1775710066000,"company_query":{"overview":null,"city":null,"state":null,"zip":null,"pan":null,"contacts":null,"sourceHistory":null,"placecoms":null,"approved":false,"company_id":1714,"company_name":"Nablon AI Private Limited","source":"Inbound Query","website_url":null,"logo":null,"industry":null,"address_line_1":null,"address_line_2":null,"is_approved":false,"is_disabled":false,"primary_placecoms":null,"secondary_placecoms":null,"created_by":9939,"updated_by":9939,"created_at":1775624506000,"updated_at":1775624506000},"questions":[],"documents":[],"offer_letter_sample_copy":[],"applicant_status":null,"eligibility_message":"","job_roles":[{"deleted":false,"published":true,"applied":false,"application_job_role_id":1555,"application_id":1225,"job_role_id":1090,"company_id":1714,"company_name":"Nablon AI Private Limited","display_name":"Nablon AI Private Limited","job_title":"Trainee Engineer - Artificial Intelligence ","job_role_label":"Trainee Engineer - Artif